{"seq":3,"slug":"lanthanides-actinides","title":"镧系、锕系与稀土元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/lanthanides-actinides","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"镧系-锕系与稀土元素\">镧系、锕系与稀土元素</h1><p>让一块手机磁铁吸力翻倍的钕、让节能灯发出红光的铕、让核反应堆运转的铀——这些改变现代生活的元素，都藏在周期表底部那两行常被忽视的 f 区里。2026 年，稀土更因供应链博弈成为全球战略焦点。这一篇是 f 区元素的详讲处，专攻镧系收缩、f 电子的弱配位场行为、稀土发光磁性与锕系放射化学，f 轨道的弱屏蔽起源见<a href=\"atomic-structure-periodicity\">原子结构与周期性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>镧系（La–Lu，对应 4f 逐渐填充）与锕系（Ac–Lr，对应 5f 填充）合称内过渡元素。它们最大的特点是化学性质由深埋的 f 电子主导，而 f 轨道被外层电子严密屏蔽，几乎不参与成键，导致同系元素性质高度相似、分离极其困难。稀土元素则是镧系十五元素再加钪、钇共十七种的统称（钇、钪半径与重镧系相近，常共生）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[f 区元素] --&gt; B[镧系 La-Lu 4f]&#10;  A --&gt; C[锕系 Ac-Lr 5f]&#10;  B --&gt; D[4f 被屏蔽&lt;br/&gt;不参与成键]&#10;  D --&gt; E[镧系收缩]&#10;  D --&gt; F[+3 为主导氧化态]&#10;  D --&gt; G[弱配位场&lt;br/&gt;窄线发光 强磁矩]&#10;  C --&gt; H[5f 较伸展&lt;br/&gt;多变氧化态]&#10;  C --&gt; I[放射性 核燃料]\">flowchart TD\n  A[f 区元素] --&gt; B[镧系 La-Lu 4f]\n  A --&gt; C[锕系 Ac-Lr 5f]\n  B --&gt; D[4f 被屏蔽&lt;br/&gt;不参与成键]\n  D --&gt; E[镧系收缩]\n  D --&gt; F[+3 为主导氧化态]\n  D --&gt; G[弱配位场&lt;br/&gt;窄线发光 强磁矩]\n  C --&gt; H[5f 较伸展&lt;br/&gt;多变氧化态]\n  C --&gt; I[放射性 核燃料]</pre><h2 id=\"镧系收缩及其后果\">镧系收缩及其后果</h2><p>从镧到镥，核电荷逐一增加，新增电子填入屏蔽能力极差的 4f 轨道，无法有效抵消核电荷增量，于是原子与离子半径沿系缓慢而持续地收缩，总收缩约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>，这就是镧系收缩。它的影响超出 f 区本身：因为收缩恰好抵消了从第二到第三过渡系本应增大的半径，使锆与铪、铌与钽这些同族对半径几乎相同、化学性质难分难解。这是周期表中最重要的跨区效应之一，呼应了<a href=\"transition-metal-chemistry\">过渡金属化学</a>中第二、三过渡系性质相近的现象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"f-电子与弱配位场效应\">f 电子与弱配位场效应</h2><p>由于 4f 轨道被 5s、5p 层屏蔽，配体对它几乎产生不了晶体场分裂——镧系离子的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 比过渡金属小约两个数量级。这带来一系列独特后果，与<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/crystal-field-ligand-field-theory\">晶体场与配位场理论</a>中过渡金属的强分裂形成鲜明对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>过渡金属（d 电子）</th>\n<th>镧系（f 电子）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配位场分裂</td>\n<td>大（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著）</td>\n<td>极小，可忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色来源</td>\n<td>d–d 跃迁，受配体影响大</td>\n<td>f–f 跃迁，窄线、几乎不受配体影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁矩</td>\n<td>仅自旋贡献为主</td>\n<td>自旋—轨道耦合显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配位数</td>\n<td>常 4、6</td>\n<td>常 8、9 甚至更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>镧系离子的磁矩必须计入轨道角动量，用总角动量量子数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>J</mi></msub><msqrt><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = g_J\\sqrt{J(J+1)}\\ \\mu_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>J</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是朗德因子。这与过渡金属仅用自旋的近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = \\sqrt{n(n+2)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不同，是 f 电子未被淬灭的轨道角动量的直接体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发光-磁性与稀土应用\">发光、磁性与稀土应用</h2><p>f–f 跃迁的窄线特性让镧系成为顶级发光材料：铕(III) 发纯红、铽(III) 发绿，用于荧光灯、显示屏与生物荧光标记；钕掺杂晶体是 Nd:YAG 激光器的核心。强磁性方面，钕铁硼（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Nd</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>Fe</mtext><mn>14</mn></msub><mtext>B</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Nd}_2\\text{Fe}_{14}\\text{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nd</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B</span></span></span></span></span></span>）是迄今最强的永磁体，撑起电动车电机、风力发电机与硬盘。这些功能材料的固体结构与机理属<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/solid-state-materials-inorganic\">固体与材料无机化学</a>的范畴。</p>\n<p>正因这些不可替代的用途，稀土已成战略资源。据 2026 年公开报道，中国主导着全球稀土开采与精炼，并对稀土实施出口管制与配额执法；美国于 2026 年 2 月宣布「Project Vault」战略关键矿产储备计划以应对供应风险（<a href=\"https://investingnews.com/daily/resource-investing/critical-metals-investing/rare-earth-investing/rare-earth-reserves-country/\">Investing News, 2026</a>）。先进提取技术据报道可将回收率较传统方法提升约 40%（<a href=\"https://farmonaut.com/mining/rare-earth-chemistry-7-innovations-in-2026\">Farmonaut, 2026</a>）。这些数据随政策波动，引用时需核对最新来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锕系与放射化学\">锕系与放射化学</h2><p>锕系的 5f 轨道比镧系的 4f 更伸展，受屏蔽较弱，因而前几个锕系元素（U、Np、Pu）能表现出多变氧化态（铀可到 +6，如铀酰 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>UO</mtext><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UO}_2^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），化学行为反而更像过渡金属。锕系最突出的特征是放射性——所有同位素都不稳定。铀-235 与钚-239 是核裂变燃料，钍则被视为更安全的下一代核燃料候选。锕系后期元素全为人工合成，半衰期极短。锕系化合物的氧化还原与配位行为同样可用前面的配位与电子转移理论分析，其取代/电子转移机理框架见<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complex-reactions-isomerism\">配合物的反应与异构现象</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分离难题与提取化学\">分离难题与提取化学</h2><p>镧系十五元素性质极其相似，把它们彼此分开是无机化学最棘手的工程之一，也是稀土昂贵的根本原因。早期靠分级结晶或分级沉淀，要重复成百上千次才能得到纯品。现代主流是溶剂萃取与离子交换：利用镧系收缩带来的离子半径微小差异，使不同稀土离子与有机萃取剂（如磷酸三丁酯、酸性膦类）的配位稳定常数略有差别，在水相与有机相间反复分配，经数百级逆流萃取逐步富集。这本质上是<a href=\"../coordination-chemistry/complexes-and-ligands\">螯合效应</a>与稳定常数差异在工业尺度的放大利用。</p>\n<p>近年的研究方向包括用对特定稀土选择性更高的新型配体、用湿法冶金从电子废料与磷石膏中回收稀土，以及生物淋滤等绿色提取。锕系分离更要叠加放射性防护与「锕系—镧系分离」的核燃料后处理难题——把次锕系元素从乏燃料中分出以便嬗变，是降低核废料长期放射性的关键，至今仍是活跃的科研前沿。理解这些分离化学，才能看懂为何稀土供应链如此集中、为何 2026 年它会成为大国博弈的筹码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>f 区元素化学由被屏蔽的 f 电子主导，同系性质高度相似、分离困难；稀土含镧系加钪钇共 17 种。</li>\n<li>镧系收缩使半径沿系缩约 20%，并跨区造成锆铪、铌钽难分的重要后果。</li>\n<li>f 电子配位场分裂极小，带来窄线 f–f 发光、需计入轨道角动量的磁矩与高配位数。</li>\n<li>镧系是顶级发光与永磁材料（NdFeB），2026 年成战略资源；锕系 5f 较伸展、多价且放射性，是核燃料来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"镧系、锕系与稀土元素","id":"镧系-锕系与稀土元素"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"镧系收缩及其后果","id":"镧系收缩及其后果"},{"level":2,"text":"f 电子与弱配位场效应","id":"f-电子与弱配位场效应"},{"level":2,"text":"发光、磁性与稀土应用","id":"发光-磁性与稀土应用"},{"level":2,"text":"锕系与放射化学","id":"锕系与放射化学"},{"level":2,"text":"分离难题与提取化学","id":"分离难题与提取化学"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"过渡金属化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/descriptive-chemistry/transition-metal-chemistry"},"next":{"title":"固体与材料无机化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/inorganic-chemistry/applications-frontiers/solid-state-materials-inorganic"}}